      ],
      "rationale": "Interpreted expiration; inspected baseline: {'core': True, 'expiration_schema': False, 'expiration': False, 'aliases': False, 'alias_min': None, 'alias_max': None, 'impacted_paths': ['service/shortener/app.py'], 'observations': ['LinkRequest and create_app match the supported core API and SQLite behavior.', 'Core routes: POST /api/links, GET /r/{code}, GET /api/links/{code}/stats, GET /health.', 'No expiration field, migration, or redirect expiration check is present.', 'Creation uses random codes; no custom-alias request field is present.']}. Required operations: ['expiration_schema', 'expiration']. Impact: links schema gains a nullable expires_at column; creation validates/persists it, redirects check it before counting, stats expose it. Core regression and migration tests must pass.",
